'''Le'mammoth''' (パオンモス, ''Paonmosu'', '''Paonmoth''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Le'mammoth
|image = E 306.png
|first appearance = [[Cats in the Snow]]<br>
'''ZL:''' [[Furious Field|Sub-chapter 7 - Furious Field]]
|money drop = 1,600¢ - 6,320¢
}}

==Enemy==
A bigger, hairier variant of [[Le'boin]] based off a Woolly Mammoth. It has the same range as Le'boin but is guaranteed to create level 3 [[Wave Attack]]s, covering a range of 867.5. Its waves combined with the [[Snowball]]s that usually spawn with it makes for a dangerous mix, and can clear the player's defense pretty quickly.

==Strategy==
There are a select few Cats that can outrange its Wave Attacks like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], but it'll take really long to kill Le'mammoth using only them. Le'mammoth's highest attack power in the whole [[Cats in the Snow]] event is just around 3000 damage, so the player can just use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to decrease its health little by little. However, they should be aware of other threats such as the Snowballs and strong peons. [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Units that are immune to waves]] could make dealing with Le'mammoth much easier.

