==Trivia==
*Le'mammoth's Japanese name, Paonmosu (パオンモス), is a portmanteau of ''Paon'' (パオン, [[Le'boin]]'s Japanese name) and ''manmosu'' (マンモス), the Japanese pronunciation of ''mammoth''.
*In the [[Media:Eve l 045 en.png|event poster]] and announcement for [[Cats in the Snow]], Le'mammoth is referred to as Mammothe, which was the only name it had until it was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

